    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Ensuing the first theme of its new strategic plan for 2021 - 2026 'Transformation through Education', AKU-SONAM has undertaken the initiative to revamp its curriculum in close coordination with the Quality, Teaching and Learning (QTL) network, office of the Provost. The move will help impart the most relevant knowledge to future nurses and midwives while preparing them to play a leadership role in our evolving global healthcare system. The new curriculum, which is currently undergoing transformation, will be at par with the top foreign nursing and midwifery universities.",
